<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="row"><view><view class="hero-title">意见反馈</view><view class="hero-sub">记录问题和改进建议</view></view><button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="goBack">返回</button></view></view><view class="notice">当前版本尚未接入服务端反馈提交。内容会保存在本机草稿中，请复制或转交管理员。</view><view class="card"><textarea class="comment-input" maxlength="2000" value="{{content}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="请描述遇到的问题、复现步骤或改进建议"></textarea><view class="row" style="margin-top:20rpx"><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="clearDraft">清空</button><button class="btn" bindtap="saveDraft">保存草稿</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{saved}}" class="card muted">草稿已保存到本机，尚未提交到服务器。</view></view>
